flowchart LR
    CLI[CLI / entry point] --> Config[Configuration validation]
    Config --> Engine[Simulation engine]
    Engine <--> State[State representation]
    Engine --> Metrics[Metrics]
    Metrics --> Serializer[Result serializer]
    Serializer --> Output[JSON / CSV artifacts]
    Diagnostics[Diagnostics] --- Engine
    Tests[Unit tests] -.-> Config
    Tests -.-> Engine
    Tests -.-> State
    Tests -.-> Metrics
